<h1>Terms of Service</h1><div class="pol"><nav class="toc"><div>On this page</div><a href="#a">Scope</a><br><a href="#b">Payments</a><br><a href="#c">Refunds</a></nav><div>
<h2 id="a">Scope</h2><p>These terms govern your use of the Acme service and every order you place with us. They apply to consumers and to businesses alike, and they explain what we do, what you do, and what happens when something goes wrong.</p>
<h2 id="b">Payments</h2><p>You pay in the currency you choose at checkout. The amount shown is the amount charged, and every payment is processed by our payment provider under its own terms, which are linked from the checkout page itself.</p>
<h2 id="c">Refunds</h2><p>Refunds follow the <a href="/refund">Refund Policy</a>. Requests are answered within five working days, and approved refunds go back to the original payment method used for the order in question.</p>
</div></div>
